description:
MxSamplez.sc lines 43-46: the mxfx reverb runs 32 CombN.ar filters, spreads them with SplayAz across 32 channels, then passes through 5 iterations of 2 AllpassN.ar filters (10 total). This runs constantly regardless of whether any reverb send is active, and sets a very high CPU baseline that leaves little headroom for 2+ instruments.

Fix: replace with FreeVerb2.ar (a single UGen, a fraction of the cost):
  snd2 = In.ar(inReverb, 2);
  snd2 = FreeVerb2.ar(snd2[0], snd2[1], mix:1, room:0.8, damp:0.5);
  Out.ar(out, snd2 * reverb);
